OL,8,     Freal boy racer attitude, hoping to
OL,9,     Freturn it to its former glory.
OL,10,G1900 Flipping Bangers
OL,11,     FMetro: Will and Gus track down a
OL,12,     F1980s Austin Metro. It's cheap,
OL,13,     Fit's clean and it's bright yellow
OL,14,     F- and they have high hopes to
OL,15,     Ftreble their money.
OL,16,G2000 Flipping Bangers
OL,17,     FMGB: Gus and Will want to buy an
OL,18,     FMGB roadster but the cheaper GT
OL,19,     Fversion is the one they find. It's
OL,20,     Fgot a few rust patches, and back
OL,21,     Fin the workshop they realise
OL,22,     Fbeauty is skin deep.
